WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.833
A chrome loop turns beside the title Multiverse Studio.

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:07.133
A clip is split on the video timeline. The resulting shot fills the screen.

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:10.900
A headline is edited on the website canvas. The view shifts to a phone layout.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:16.900
CSS changes beside the live Afterimage preview. The page turns lavender.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.267
The Assistant answers a question about the open project.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:23.600
Vermilion, Graphite, and Paper appear in turn, then together in the Multiverse.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.333
Video, code, and websites appear side by side.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:30.000
The silver sculpture turns on a dark stage beside the Multiverse Studio title.
